RD PARTIES OR A FAILURE OF THE PROGRAM TO OPERATE WITH ANY OTHER\nPROGRAMS), EVEN IF SUCH HOLDER OR OTHER PARTY HAS BEEN ADVISED OF THE\nPOSSIBILITY OF SUCH DAMAGES.\n\n---------------------------\nEND OF TERMS AND CONDITIONS\";s:6:\"readme\";s:772:\"--------------------\nAjaxSnippet\n--------------------\nAuthor: Vasiliy Naumkin <bezumkin@yandex.ru>\n--------------------\n\nSimple component for MODX Revolution, that allows you to run any snippet through ajax.\n\nCall AjaxSnippet at any page\n\n[[!AjaxSnippet?snippet=`pdoResources`&parents=`0`]]\n\n\nYou can specify any parameters for end snippet:\n\n[[!AjaxSnippet?\n	&snippet=`pdoResources`\n	&parents=`0`\n	&tpl=`@INLINE <p>[[+idx]]. <a href=\"[[+link]]\">[[+pagetitle]]</a></p>`\n	&useWeblinkUrl=`1`\n	&etc=`...`\n]]\n\n\nYou can use jQuery event \"as_complete\" for custom functionality:\n\n$(document).on(\'as_complete\', document, function(e,d) {\n	console.log(d);\n})\n\n\n--------------------\nFeel free to suggest ideas/improvements/bugs on GitHub:\nhttp://github.com/bezumkin/AjaxSnippet/issues\";}', 'AjaxSnippet', 'a:35:{s:2:\"id\";s:2:\"45\";s:10:\"repository\";s:1:\"1\";s:4:\"name\";s:11:\"AjaxSnippet\";s:9:\"createdby\";s:1:\"6\";s:9:\"createdon\";s:19:\"2014-01-30 12:44:13\";s:8:\"editedon\";s:19:\"0000-00-00 00:00:00\";s:7:\"license\";s:5:\"GPLv2\";s:10:\"screenshot\";s:0:\"\";s:9:\"downloads\";s:4:\"2030\";s:8:\"approved\";s:1:\"1\";s:6:\"active\";s:1:\"1\";s:7:\"package\";s:2:\"45\";s:7:\"version\";s:5:\"1.1.1\";s:13:\"version_major\";s:1:\"1\";s:13:\"version_minor\";s:1:\"1\";s:13:\"version_patch\";s:1:\"1\";s:7:\"release\";s:2:\"pl\";s:13:\"release_index\";s:0:\"\";s:9:\"signature\";s:20:\"ajaxsnippet-1.1.1-pl\";s:12:\"instructions\";s:0:\"\";s:9:\"changelog\";s:644:\"Changelog for AjaxSnippet.<br />\n<br />\n1.1.1-pl<br />\n==============<br />\n- Improved caching.<br />\n- Replaced loading image.<br />\n<br />\n1.1.0-pl1<br />\n==============<br />\n- &#91;#1&#93; Fixed empty response from snippet.<br />\n- Run processing of elements only when it needed.<br />\n- Added ability to run snippet by clicking on special trigger link.<br />\n- New parameter in snippet: &quot;mode&quot;, &quot;trigger&quot; and &quot;target&quot;.<br />\n- Fixed url for ajax requests.<br />\n<br />\n1.0.1-pl<br />\n==============<br />\n- Added plugin for quicker response.<br />\n<br />\n1.0.0-pl<br />\n==============<br />\n- Initial release.\";s:10:\"releasedby\";s:1:\"6\";s:10:\"releasedon\";s:19:\"2014-10-13 23:17:43\";s:16:\"minimum_supports\";s:3:\"2.2\";s:8:\"supports\";s:0:\"\";s:11:\"minimum_php\";s:0:\"\";s:10:\"deprecated\";s:1:\"0\";s:10:\"version_id\";s:3:\"280\";s:6:\"author\";s:29:\"Василий Наумкин\";s:11:\"description\";s:241:\"Компонент, для запуска сниппетов через Ajax.\n\nПозволяет подгружать блоки новостей или комментариев после загрузки основной страницы.\";s:5:\"price\";s:1:\"0\";s:12:\"display_name\";s:20:\"ajaxsnippet-1.1.1-pl\";s:11:\"supports_db\";s:5:\"mysql\";s:8:\"location\";s:153:\"https://modstore.pro/extras/package/45?version_id=280&username=yura%40chizhik.net&api_key=416c19f6a2a7c03ab916e59314c9a44f&http_host=dverokon.chizhik.net\";s:4:\"file\";a:2:{s:8:\"location\";s:153:\"https://modstore.pro/extras/package/45?version_id=280&username=yura%40chizhik.net&api_key=416c19f6a2a7c03ab916e59314c9a44f&http_host=dverokon.chizhik.net\";s:9:\"transport\";s:4:\"true\";}}', 1, 1, 1, 'pl', 0);
